Relevant columns and their potential usage  
• `OrderID`: unique identifier → tradeID  
• `MaturityDate`: contract‑expiry timestamp → tradeTimestamp  
• `TargetCompID`: first four characters map to trading algorithm → algorithm  
• `Symbol`: trading symbol of the instrument → symbol  
• `LastPx`: price at which the CFD was entered → openPrice  
• `StrikePrice`: price at which the CFD closed → closePrice (used to rank)  
• `Sides.Side`: LONG / SHORT direction → tradeDirection  
• `Sides.Side` (mapped) → tradeMultiplier (1 for LONG, –1 for SHORT)

Typical condition for the final request  
ORDER BY `StrikePrice` DESC  
LIMIT 6  

