• `LastPx`: price at which the CFD was entered → openPrice  
• `StrikePrice`: price at which the CFD closed → closePrice (used to rank)  
• `Sides.Side`: LONG / SHORT direction → tradeDirection  
• `Sides.Side` (mapped) → tradeMultiplier (1 for LONG, –1 for SHORT)

